{{wikipedia|dab=overflow}}
==English==

===Etymology===
[[over]] + [[flow]]

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[spillage]] resultant from overflow; [[excess]].

====Translations====
* Spanish: {{t-|es|desbordamiento|m}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[fill]] beyond the [[limit]]s of a [[container]] or [[system]].
# {{context|computing|transitive}} To compute a [[number]] outside the [[range]] of (a [[register]] or [[variable]] which is holding it).

